26-10-30T20:28:34Z"},"message":"fix(desktop): keep a probe's cache update in memory when its write fails\n\nrefresh() is best-effort by design: what a probe learned (a pending entry adopting its\nfolder's id) holds whether or not the write succeeded, so it opts out of the rollback.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"29513bb3e9f13fa4a2b4e13a9c2c64d2c28f3d8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niway-dev/kaipu-record/git/trees/29513bb3e9f13fa4a2b4e13a9c2c64d2c28f3d8e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niway-dev/kaipu-record/git/commits/df1a80f674b61b99a817e1c85ac43ddc133b0189","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niway-dev/kaipu-record/commits/df1a80f674b61b99a817e1c85ac43ddc133b0189","html_url":"https://github.com/niway-dev/kaipu-record/commit/df1a80f674b61b99a817e1c85ac43ddc133b0189","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niway-dev/kaipu-record/commits/df1a80f674b61b99a817e1c85ac43ddc133b0189/comments","author":{"login":"csdev19","id":32802631,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyODAyNjMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32802631?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19","html_url":"https://github.com/csdev19","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"csdev19","id":32802631,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyODAyNjMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32802631?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19","html_url":"https://github.com/csdev19","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"b69ce68b68a0c0e483e4dca4a86158cf82a628f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niway-dev/kaipu-record/commits/b69ce68b68a0c0e483e4dca4a86158cf82a628f0","html_url":"https://github.com/niway-dev/kaipu-record/commit/b69ce68b68a0c0e483e4dca4a86158cf82a628f0"}]},{"sha":"281451c3e5b086db94f41bc4df02dee25c81479d","node_id":"C_kwDOS7iax9oAKDI4MTQ1MWMzZTViMDg2ZGI5NGY0MWJjNGRmMDJkZWUyNWM4MTQ3OWQ","commit":{"author":{"name":"Cristian Sotomayor","email":"cristiansotomayor.dev@gmail.com","date":"2026-10-30T20:29:22Z"},"committer":{"name":"Cristian Sotomayor","email":"cristiansotomayor.dev@gmail.com","date":"2026-10-30T20:29:22Z"},"message":"fix(desktop): probe the folder before the editor's Save enters the gate\n\nA pending workspace adopting its folder's id during the probe bumps the generation. Inside\nthe scoped call that made the preload report a save that did write as stale, and saving\nagain duplicated the item. Probed first, the same adoption refuses the call before it writes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"80ea7f9eb5fd9e29135172520387b40b51b720a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niway-dev/kaipu-record/git/trees/80ea7f9eb5fd9e29135172520387b40b51b720a7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niway-dev/kaipu-record/git/commits/281451c3e5b086db94f41bc4df02dee25c81479d","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niway-dev/kaipu-record/commits/281451c3e5b086db94f41bc4df02dee25c81479d","html_url":"https://github.com/niway-dev/kaipu-record/commit/281451c3e5b086db94f41bc4df02dee25c81479d","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niway-dev/kaipu-record/commits/281451c3e5b086db94f41bc4df02dee25c81479d/comments","author":{"login":"csdev19","id":32802631,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyODAyNjMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32802631?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19","html_url":"https://github.com/csdev19","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"csdev19","id":32802631,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyODAyNjMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32802631?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19","html_url":"https://github.com/csdev19","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"df1a80f674b61b99a817e1c85ac43ddc133b0189","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niway-dev/kaipu-record/commits/df1a80f674b61b99a817e1c85ac43ddc133b0189","html_url":"https://github.com/niway-dev/kaipu-record/commit/df1a80f674b61b99a817e1c85ac43ddc133b0189"}]},{"sha":"32ca6a98d8f598a97ccc02f9d3e0ccea14c4027e","node_id":"C_kwDOS7iax9oAKDMyY2E2YTk4ZDhmNTk4YTk3Y2NjMDJmOWQzZTBjY2VhMTRjNDAyN2U","commit":{"author":{"name":"Cristian Sotomayor","email":"cristiansotomayor.dev@gmail.com","date":"2026-10-30T20:30:02Z"},"committer":{"name":"Cristian Sotomayor","email":"cristiansotomayor.dev@gmail.com","date":"2026-10-30T20:30:02Z"},"message":"fix(desktop): only the broadcast that ends a switch clears the preload's switching guard\n\nRegistry edits and lock changes also broadcast workspaces:changed, under the same stamp.\nThey cleared the guard while a switch was still under way, so the window took item calls\nagain under the old stamp. The stamp and guard live in a small tested module; the guard\nclears on a changed stamp or an abort only.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"58448dc4bb9296c74f5f8bdf668ec4b0dd07d224","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niway-dev/kaipu-record/git/trees/58448dc4bb9296c74f5f8bdf668ec4b0dd07d224"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niway-dev/kaipu-record/git/commits/32ca6a98d8f598a97ccc02f9d3e0ccea14c4027e","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niway-dev/kaipu-record/commits/32ca6a98d8f598a97ccc02f9d3e0ccea14c4027e","html_url":"https://github.com/niway-dev/kaipu-record/commit/32ca6a98d8f598a97ccc02f9d3e0ccea14c4027e","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niway-dev/kaipu-record/commits/32ca6a98d8f598a97ccc02f9d3e0ccea14c4027e/comments","author":{"login":"csdev19","id":32802631,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyODAyNjMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32802631?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19","html_url":"https://github.com/csdev19","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"csdev19","id":32802631,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyODAyNjMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32802631?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19","html_url":"https://github.com/csdev19","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/csdev19/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"281451c3e5b086db94f41bc4df02dee25c81479d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niway-dev/kaipu-record/commits/281451c3e5b086db94f41bc4df02dee25c81479d","html_url":"https://github.com/niway-dev/kaipu-record/commit/281451c3e5b086db94f41bc4df02dee25c81479d"}]},{"sha":"aa9ac6094d8b4338294efa35f9ceacf6dcb6bcef","node_id":"C_kwDOS7iax9oAKGFhOWFjNjA5NGQ4YjQzMzgyOTRlZmEzNWY5Y2VhY2Y2ZGNiNmJjZWY","commit":{"author":{"name":"Cristian Sotomayor","email":"cristiansotomayor.dev@gmail.com","date":"2026-10-30T20:32:54Z"},"committer":{"name":"Cristian Sotomayor","email":"cristiansotomayor.dev@gmail.com","date":"2026-10-30T20:32:54Z"},"message":"fix(desktop): stamp every renderer media URL with its workspace\n\nThe protocol already refused a stamped URL of another workspace for any kind, but the\nrenderer built recording and screenshot URLs by hand without the stamp, so a cached video\nURL could play another workspace's item. They now go through mediaUrl(), which reads the\nwindow's workspace from the preload; a test fails if a hand-built kaipu-media:// URL\nreappears in the renderer.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2e3724a0f1335212c1779217979cc101b98cede7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niway-dev/kaipu-record/git/trees/2e3724a0f1335212c1779217979cc101b98cede7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niway-dev/kaipu-record/git/commits/aa9ac6094d8b4338294efa35f9ceacf6dcb6bcef","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/niway-dev/kaipu-record/commits/a